    "abstract": "Parts figure for the generator control unit installation in the aft distribution bay, covering the relay assembly, the splice module in its two standards and the mounting rail bonding hardware.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure shows the generator control unit installation in the aft distribution bay, with the relay assembly, the splice module and the bonding hardware at the mounting rail.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the rack and the relay assembly looking outboard; sheet 2 shows the splice module and the status line contacts introduced by the second issue of the thermal protection work. Items 20 and 20A are the two splice module standards and are not interchangeable: the uprated module at item 20 carries the maintenance status line and has a different mounting footprint, and the shear head bolts at item 30 belong to that footprint only. Until this issue the module was catalogued once, and an operator ordering from the figure could receive a module whose fixing holes do not line up with the rail it is going onto. The bonding hardware at item 40 is common to both standards and is supplied loose."
    },
